Everything that was killed by you, your pet, itself, each other, traps,
accidents and collateral damage while you were on the level that it was
on[1] gets on the kill list.

[1] and nothing ever happens on levels that you're not on, except
corpses rotting away.

You only get experience (and blame) for what *you* kill, however. This
includes, I think, blame (not experience) for pets and peaceful
critters killed by traps that you've set or that you displace it into.

